<Base title="About Careerconnect NG" description="About Careerconnect NG, a platform for discovering job opportunities in Nigeria."><section class="wrap about"><p class="eyebrow blue">ABOUT US</p><h1>Helping you find<br><span>your next opportunity.</span></h1><p>Careerconnect NG is designed to make job discovery clearer and easier for people exploring opportunities across Nigeria.</p><h2>Our approach</h2><p>We organize vacancy information and direct applicants to the application destination supplied for each listing. Applicants should confirm the employer, review requirements and deadlines, and avoid recruiters asking for payment to secure a job.</p><a class="btn" href="/#jobs">Explore vacancies ↗</a></section></Base>
